{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":37,"alongside":41,"kin":46,"engines":71,"usedOn":72,"sites":73,"crewed":74,"museums":75,"hero":76},null,{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"specs":15,"links":18,"linked_missions":34,"tagline":35,"description":36},"lucy","Lucy","orbiter","NASA","USA","Lockheed Martin","2021-10-16","ACTIVE","2011-now","commercial-era","首次朝向木星特洛伊小行星的任务","Added with /fly mission JSON (#341 batch 5).",{"length_m":16,"diameter_m":17},16,1.7,[19,23,27,30],{"l":20,"u":21,"t":22},"The Lucy Spacecraft — NASA (16 m tip to tip, arrays deployed)","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lucy/spacecraft/","core",{"l":24,"u":25,"t":26},"Lucy (spacecraft) — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucy_(spacecraft)","intro",{"l":28,"u":29,"t":22},"Lucy mission overview (NASA)","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lucy/",{"l":31,"u":32,"t":33},"Levison et al. (2021) — Lucy Mission to the Trojan Asteroids (Space Science Reviews)","https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11214-021-00845-4","deep",[3],"首次前往木星特洛伊小行星的任务","NASA耗时12年的多次飞掠任务，造访6个木星特洛伊小行星系统和2颗主小行星带小行星（共11次相遇，包括卫星）。三次地球引力辅助确立单一轨迹，同时访问L4和L5特洛伊云团。以1974年发现的南方古猿化石命名，而该化石又以披头士乐队歌曲命名——寓意特洛伊小行星保存早期太阳系物质，就像该化石保存人类早期历史一样。",[38],{"id":3,"name":4,"first":39,"year":40},"首个探访木星特洛伊小行星的任务；在单次12年的轨道飞行中造访8颗小行星及其卫星上的11个天体——这是造访各自独立绕太阳运行的天体数量的纪录",2021,[42],{"id":43,"name":44,"tagline":45},"atlas-v","Atlas V","United Launch Alliance的改进型Atlas",[47,51,55,59,63,67],{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"dart","DART","第一行星防御撞击器(双卫一)",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"psyche-spacecraft","Psyche","首次前往金属丰富的M型小行星的任务",{"id":56,"name":57,"tagline":58},"europa-clipper","Europa Clipper","首个专门表征木卫二宜居性的任务",{"id":60,"name":61,"tagline":62},"parker-solar-probe","Parker Solar Probe","迄今距离太阳最近的航天器",{"id":64,"name":65,"tagline":66},"osiris-rex","OSIRIS-REx","已将贝努样本送回地球（2023 年）；现正前往 Apophis",{"id":68,"name":69,"tagline":70},"maven","MAVEN","火星大气流失至太阳风",[],[],[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/lucy/03.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
